OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdry for most of the night, but clear
OL,7,Fspells, coupled with light winds,
OL,8,Fallow some fog to develop by the early
OL,9,Fhours of Thursday morning, especially
OL,10,Facross Norfolk and Suffolk.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMorning fog will slowly
OL,13,Fclear, followed by a bright and sunny
OL,14,Fafternoon, with the wind remaining
OL,15,Flight. Feeling warm for some in the
OL,16,Fsunshine for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
