OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSettled
OL,6,Fand largely dry in the coming days.
OL,7,FLight winds allow widespread fog to
OL,8,Fform during the mornings, slowly
OL,9,Fburning away to give prolonged sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
